@ocr_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

### Login (any username/password)
POST {{ocr_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### username=test&password=test

### Who am I
GET {{ocr_HostAddress}}/whoami
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST {{ocr_HostAddress}}/logout

###
